  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Propanal</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Methanal</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaCN</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><munder><mrow><mi>roduct</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder></math></p><p>The correct statement for product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is. It is</p>"
  },
